@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:For the company, the first step is to look at the order.;
:If the order is to be rejected, the process should continue. If the order is to be accepted, the process should also continue.;
split
:Preparing the assembling order;
split again
:Checking availability;
end split
:v_availability: Availability Status ({Backorder, Reserved}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v_availability = 'Backorder'])
:Availability needs to be checked again;
stop
else ([v_availability = 'Reserved'])
:If the item can be reserved, the process should continue.;
:The next steps are to assemble the bike and then ship the product.;
stop
endif
@enduml